Calypsalm
Ingredients: POST-ROCK + EUPHORIC, ENERGETIC & JOLLY + Steel Drums
Creative Catalyst: Rogue recordists in the Pyrenees smuggled out sleep-state modular synth voltage charts drafted by cloistered monks, re-pitching the nocturnal sequences through hammered Caribbean steel drums.

Calypsalm is a rapturous, sweat-drenched collision of skyward post-rock momentum and carnival-grade rhythmic ecstasy. Instead of post-rock’s customary grey melancholia and glacial pacing, Calypsalm launches at full sprint: shimmering tremolo-picked electric guitars and towering fuzz swells lock into rapid-fire, polyrhythmic double-tenor steel drums, backed by driving krautrock percussion and dream-derived modular synth sequences that blossom into joyous, tearful communal explosions.

